Version: 3.0.0
Release Date: 2026-08-22
Codename: Plugin-First
Status: Stable

## Release Notes

Plugin-first — agent-server, agent CLI, and GUI removed; the Claude Code plugin is the
product. Claude Code natively provides the agent execution loop, so the API-driven Go
server (port 8082), the `agent` CLI, the `agent-mcp` MCP server, and the React GUI have
been deleted from the tree. Server era preserved at tag `v2.0-server-final`.

### What remains
- `plugin/` — 6 subagents, 3 skills (orchestrate, pre-push, shepherd-pr), kg MCP config
- `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` — local marketplace (`make install-plugin`)
- `templates/`, `scripts/`, `docs/`, `assets/`

